Kau akan baik-baik saja.

505
00:47:08,262 --> 00:47:09,897
Ya.

506
00:47:11,800 --> 00:47:13,467
Ini dia. Baiklah.

507
00:47:14,769 --> 00:47:16,904
Baiklah, kau baik-baik saja?

508
00:47:16,937 --> 00:47:20,974
-Ya, aku baik-baik saja.
-Baiklah. Ini dia.

509
00:47:25,814 --> 00:47:29,684
Baiklah.
Mari duduk di sini.

510
00:47:29,751 --> 00:47:31,485
Di mana itu?

511
00:47:32,620 --> 00:47:35,657
Baiklah, bagus.

512
00:47:35,724 --> 00:47:37,559
Persetan!

513
00:47:38,992 --> 00:47:40,994
Apa yang mereka inginkan?

514
00:47:42,463 --> 00:47:45,032
Apa... ini?
Apa... apa benda ini?

515
00:47:45,099 --> 00:47:47,334
Apakah ini bernilai banyak uang?

516
00:47:52,707 --> 00:47:54,241
Ini tidak...

517
00:47:56,443 --> 00:47:58,946
Kau harusnya dikelilingi
orang-orang terkasih,

518
00:47:59,012 --> 00:48:01,115
bukan oleh seseorang sepertiku.

519
00:48:04,084 --> 00:48:07,121
<i>Sarah,
jika kau sempat</i> <i>mendengar ini,</i>

520
00:48:07,187 --> 00:48:10,692
<i>penderitaanmu</i> <i>adalah karena kami.</i>

521
00:48:10,759 --> 00:48:13,460
<i>Terlalu banyak risiko.</i>

522
00:48:13,528 --> 00:48:16,163
<i>Terlalu banyak kontak</i> <i>dengan alam gaib.</i>

523
00:48:16,230 --> 00:48:18,132
<i>Kita harus menguburnya.</i>

524
00:48:18,198 --> 00:48:20,968
<i>Maaf
kami mementingkan</i> <i>ini daripada kau.</i>

525
00:48:21,034 --> 00:48:23,638
<i>Aku takkan pernah</i> <i>melibatkanmu lagi.</i>

526
00:48:24,672 --> 00:48:26,140
<i>Ada apa dengan kita?</i>

527
00:48:26,206 --> 00:48:28,976
<i>Baiklah.
Pastor, mulai doanya.</i>

528
00:48:30,879 --> 00:48:32,980
<i>Maafkan aku.</i>
<i>Ini dimaksudkan untuk...</i>

529
00:48:33,046 --> 00:48:34,582
<i>Berhenti, berhenti.</i>
<i>Tolong jangan lakukan ini.</i>

530
00:48:34,649 --> 00:48:36,851
<i>Maafkan aku.</i>

531
00:48:36,984 --> 00:48:38,185
Apakah itu...

532
00:48:38,252 --> 00:48:39,554
<i>Bantu aku. Ibu!</i>

533
00:48:39,621 --> 00:48:41,155
-...bayimu?
<i>-Tidak, Ibu, kumohon.</i>

534
00:48:41,221 --> 00:48:42,624
<i>Dia tidak baik-baik saja.</i>

535
00:48:42,690 --> 00:48:44,158
<i>Dia akan baik-baik saja.</i>

536
00:48:44,224 --> 00:48:45,560
<i>Berhenti! Berhenti!</i>

537
00:48:45,627 --> 00:48:47,227
<i>Dia
akan melihat ke dalam kotak.</i>

538
00:48:47,294 --> 00:48:48,228
<i>Apa... apa ini?</i>

539
00:48:51,465 --> 00:48:52,834
<i>Lihat dia!</i>

540
00:48:52,901 --> 00:48:54,201
<i>Tolong!</i>

541
00:48:55,804 --> 00:48:57,438
<i>Berhenti!
Berhenti! Berhenti!</i>

542
00:48:57,505 --> 00:48:59,106
<i>Itu dia.</i>

543
